&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Muhterem Genel Başkanlarım, Grup Başkanımız, Grup Başkan Vekillerimiz, kıymetli milletvekillerimiz, partilerimizin değerli y&amp;ouml;neticileri, değerli misafirler, ekranları başında bizleri izleyen değerli vatandaşlarımız, Yeni Yol Ortak Meclis Grubumuzun, 4. Yasama Yılı ilk grup toplantısına hoş geldiniz, sefalar getirdiniz.&lt;a name=&quot;bookmark=id.gjdgxs&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_heading=h.30j0zll&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805059&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ouml;ZG&amp;Uuml;RL&amp;Uuml;K FİLOSUNA İSRAİL&amp;rsquo;İN SALDIRISI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Konuşmamın başında &amp;Ouml;zg&amp;uuml;rl&amp;uuml;k Filosu&amp;rsquo;nu, başta Milletvekillerimiz Mehmet Atmaca&amp;rsquo;yı, Necmettin &amp;Ccedil;alışkan&amp;rsquo;ı, Sema Silkin &amp;Uuml;n&amp;rsquo;&amp;uuml;, bu filonun t&amp;uuml;m kaptanlarını, t&amp;uuml;m aktivistlerini,&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;filonun oluşmasında emeği ge&amp;ccedil;en herkesi derin bir saygı ile selamlıyorum.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Maalesef T&amp;uuml;rkiye ve diğer b&amp;ouml;lge &amp;uuml;lkeleri, ter&amp;ouml;r devleti İsrail&amp;rsquo;in uluslararası sularda ne &amp;Ouml;zg&amp;uuml;rl&amp;uuml;k Filosu&amp;rsquo;ndaki ne de Sumud Filosu&amp;rsquo;ndaki 572 aktivistin alıkoymasına engel olamadı. Bu tablo, T&amp;uuml;rkiye Cumhuriyeti Devletine asla yakışmaz!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İşgalci İsrail sadece Gazze ve Filistin i&amp;ccedil;in değil, T&amp;uuml;rkiye başta olmak &amp;uuml;zere b&amp;uuml;t&amp;uuml;n b&amp;ouml;lge i&amp;ccedil;in b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k bir tehdittir! Bu tehdit ve tehlikenin bir an evvel bertaraf edilmesi i&amp;ccedil;in T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;nin diğer b&amp;ouml;lge &amp;uuml;lkelerine de &amp;ouml;nc&amp;uuml;l&amp;uuml;k ederek, somut adım ve yaptırımları hayata ge&amp;ccedil;irmesi ka&amp;ccedil;ınılmazdır.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;B&amp;uuml;t&amp;uuml;n olan bitenlerden yola &amp;ccedil;ıkarak, yetkililere -defalarca &amp;ccedil;ağrıda bulunduk- bir kez daha &amp;ccedil;ağrıda bulunuyoruz:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İlk &amp;ccedil;ağrımız Sayın Cumhurbaşkanına!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sayın Cumhurbaşkanı, T&amp;uuml;rkiye Cumhuriyeti Devletinin se&amp;ccedil;ilmiş 3 milletvekili, İsrail askerleri tarafından uluslararası sularda alıkonulmuştur. Bu durum karşısında; Milletvekillerimiz herhangi bir İsrail hapishanesine girmeden, herhangi bir başka muamele g&amp;ouml;rmeden, hatta g&amp;ouml;zaltına bile alınmadan derhal T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;ye getirilmesini sağlayın. Bu T&amp;uuml;rkiye Cumhuriyeti devletinin itibarı meselesidir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ayrıca derhal Milli G&amp;uuml;venlik Kurulu&amp;rsquo;nu ve t&amp;uuml;m g&amp;uuml;venlik b&amp;uuml;rokrasisini artık harekete ge&amp;ccedil;irin. İsrail i&amp;ccedil;in; ticari, hukuki, siyasi ve askeri t&amp;uuml;m caydırıcı tedbirleri kamuoyuna acilen a&amp;ccedil;ıklayın.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İlk iş olarak: İncirlik ve K&amp;uuml;recik &amp;uuml;ss&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml; kapatın, İsrail k&amp;ouml;r olsun! Petrol vanalarını kapatın, İsrail&amp;rsquo;in u&amp;ccedil;akları kalkamasın! B&amp;uuml;t&amp;uuml;n limanları kapatın, İsrail&amp;rsquo;in can damarı kesilsin!&lt;br /&gt;
Buradan bir kez daha sesleniyoruz: Sumud Filosu&amp;rsquo;nun, &amp;Ouml;zg&amp;uuml;rl&amp;uuml;k Filosu&amp;rsquo;nun &amp;ldquo;hukuki akıbeti&amp;rdquo;, Mavi Marmara&amp;rsquo;daki gibi olmasın. Bu vicdan girişimi, hi&amp;ccedil;bir maddi bedele, hi&amp;ccedil;bir anlaşmaya kurban edilemez. Bu ve bundan sonraki filoların akıbeti bellidir: Ablukayı kırmak ve Gazze sahilinde bekleyen o &amp;ccedil;ocuklar ile buluşmak!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İkinci &amp;ccedil;ağrımız Sayın Meclis Başkanına!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sayın Kurtulmuş, başkanlığını yaptığınız TBMM&amp;rsquo;nin milletvekilleri İsrail tarafından bu gece alıkonuldu. Şimdi, uluslararası kamuoyunu harekete ge&amp;ccedil;irmek i&amp;ccedil;in,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;nin g&amp;uuml;venliğini tesis etmek i&amp;ccedil;in,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ve en &amp;ouml;nemlisi Filistin konusundaki kararlılığımızı t&amp;uuml;m d&amp;uuml;nyaya g&amp;ouml;stermek i&amp;ccedil;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İhtiya&amp;ccedil; olan tezkereyi meclis g&amp;uuml;ndemine getirin.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ccedil;&amp;uuml;nk&amp;uuml; iktidar vekilleri bizim 22 kez verdiğimiz &amp;ouml;neriyi her seferinde reddettiler! Unutmayın! Bu Meclis, ayağında &amp;ccedil;arıkla kucağında &amp;ccedil;ocukla, sırtında mermiyle kurtuluş savaşı vermiş bir meclistir. K&amp;uuml;resel ter&amp;ouml;ristlerden, reel politik aldatmacasından &amp;ccedil;ekinmeyin, endişe etmeyin. Siz bu iradeyi ortaya koyun, hi&amp;ccedil; ş&amp;uuml;pheniz olmasın, t&amp;uuml;m Meclis arkanızda olacaktır, t&amp;uuml;m milletimiz arkanızda olacaktır, t&amp;uuml;m Milli G&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;ş&amp;ccedil;&amp;uuml;ler arkanızda olacaktır.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805060&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;SUMUD FİLOSU&amp;rsquo;NA TEŞEKK&amp;Uuml;R&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ayrıca tabii d&amp;uuml;n yurda d&amp;ouml;nen, y&amp;uuml;z akı dostlarımız var! D&amp;uuml;n, T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;ye gelen bize ve t&amp;uuml;m mazlumlara umut olan, t&amp;uuml;m tehdit ve engellemelere rağmen yola &amp;ccedil;ıkan, İsrail&amp;rsquo;in zulm&amp;uuml;ne boyun eğmeyen, Gazze kara sularına kararlılıkla ulaşarak ablukayı delen, reel politiği de Akdeniz&amp;rsquo;in dibine g&amp;ouml;men, Sumud Filosu&amp;rsquo;ndaki t&amp;uuml;m kardeşlerimi kutluyorum! Allah sizlerden razı olsun!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805061&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;GAZZEDE SOYKIRIMIN 2. YILI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Milletvekillerine, aktivistlere, vicdanlı insanlara t&amp;uuml;m bu saldırılar, alıkoymalar, fiziksel ve psikolojik şiddet, Siyonist İsrail&amp;#39;in Gazze&amp;rsquo;de uyguladığı soykırımın tam da ikinci yıl d&amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml;m&amp;uuml;nde yaşandı!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Evet! Bug&amp;uuml;n 8 Ekim 2025. Tarihin hi&amp;ccedil;bir d&amp;ouml;neminde, bu kadar pervasızca &amp;ldquo;&amp;ccedil;ocuk katliamı&amp;rdquo; olmadı, &amp;ldquo;Zul&amp;uuml;m&amp;rdquo; bu kadar pervasızca yapılmadı! Hukuksuzluk hi&amp;ccedil; bu kadar meşrulaştırılmadı! İsrail, Filistin topraklarında, Gazze kara sularında iki yıldır değil, 77 yıldır işgalci. 14 Mayıs 1948&amp;rsquo;de İsrail neyse, 8 Ekim 2025 sabahı da odur. Bu sabah i&amp;ccedil;inde milletvekillerimizin olduğu gemiye hukuksuzca m&amp;uuml;dahalesi işte bunun ispatıdır.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805062&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;HALKLAR &amp;ldquo;İNİSİYATİF&amp;rdquo; ALMIŞTIR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Devletlerin ve liderlerin, iki y&amp;uuml;zl&amp;uuml; tutumuna karşı; d&amp;uuml;nya halkları artık dayanamadı, inisiyatif aldı, &amp;ldquo;siz yoksanız biz varız!&amp;rdquo; dedi! İşte! &amp;ldquo;&amp;Ouml;zg&amp;uuml;rl&amp;uuml;k Filosu&amp;rdquo; ve &amp;ldquo;K&amp;uuml;resel Sumud Filosu&amp;rdquo; bunların sonucunda ortaya &amp;ccedil;ıkmıştır.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805063&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;SUMUD AMA&amp;Ccedil; DEĞİL ARA&amp;Ccedil;TIR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Değerli arkadaşlar, şunun &amp;ouml;zellikle bilinmesini isterim. K&amp;uuml;resel Sumud Filosu, &amp;Ouml;zg&amp;uuml;rl&amp;uuml;k Filosu, aslında bir ama&amp;ccedil; değil bir ara&amp;ccedil;tı. Ara&amp;ccedil;, amacın &amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml;ne asla ge&amp;ccedil;memeli! Sumud Filosu&amp;rsquo;nun mesajı iyi anlaşılmalı ve gereği yapılmalıdır. Sumud Filosunun mesajı net:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Biz &amp;uuml;zerimize d&amp;uuml;şeni yaptık, artık dağılabiliriz&amp;rdquo; değil; iktidarları ve liderleri somut adım atmak &amp;uuml;zere harekete ge&amp;ccedil;irmektir. Bu sabah milletvekillerimiz, aktivistler, vicdanlı insanlar bu &amp;ldquo;mesajın&amp;rdquo; bedelini &amp;ouml;demiştir! Bug&amp;uuml;n eksik olan, iktidarların somut adımlarıdır.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bizler, T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;de iktidarın Gazze konusunda &amp;ldquo;somut adım&amp;rdquo; atması i&amp;ccedil;in b&amp;ouml;yle bir girişimin en b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k paydaşlarından biri olduk.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805064&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;SİZ GEREKENİ YAPSAYDINIZ SUMUDA İHTİYA&amp;Ccedil; OLMAYACAKTI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Şunu ifade edeyim: İktidar, 2 yıldır gerekeni yapsaydı bug&amp;uuml;n Sumud&amp;rsquo;a ihtiya&amp;ccedil; olmayacaktı! İnsani yardım koridoru tekliflerimizi Meclis&amp;rsquo;te kabul etseydiniz, Sumud Filosu&amp;rsquo;na ihtiya&amp;ccedil; olmayacaktı. T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;den İsrail&amp;rsquo;e savaşmaya giden &amp;ccedil;ifte vatandaşları belirleyin, gerekeni yapın &amp;ccedil;ağrılarımıza kulak verseydiniz Filo&amp;rsquo;daki insanlarımız, T&amp;uuml;rkiye vatandaşları tarafından o muameleyi g&amp;ouml;rmeyecekti!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;K&amp;uuml;recik&amp;rsquo;i ve İncirlik&amp;rsquo;i kapatsaydınız, Vanaları, limanları, hava sahasını kapatsaydınız,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Mitinglere, y&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;şlere, Sumud&amp;rsquo;a bug&amp;uuml;n ihtiya&amp;ccedil; olmayacaktı. Bir tane tek bir tane somut adım atmış olsaydınız, bu k&amp;uuml;rs&amp;uuml;den bunları konuşmamıza ihtiya&amp;ccedil; olmayacaktı.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805065&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;GEREKEN YERDE YOKSUNUZ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;22 kez Meclis&amp;rsquo;te bu konuyu konuşalım diye teklif verdik! Siz 22 teklifin hepsini ellerinizi red oyu i&amp;ccedil;in kaldırarak reddettiniz. Somut adım atmıyorsunuz, gemide yoksunuz, uğurlamada yoksunuz ama havaalanındaki karşılamada en &amp;ouml;ndesiniz!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu nasıl iş Allah aşkına? &amp;ldquo;Ne şiş yansın ne kebap yansın&amp;rdquo; diye ifade edebileceğimiz bir İsrail politikanız var. Hem Amerika&amp;rsquo;yı hem İsrail&amp;#39;i hem de Gazze&amp;#39;yi memnun eden bir plan olmaz, olamaz!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Kola d&amp;ouml;k&amp;uuml;p, hamburgerci basmaya varsınız ama İsrail&amp;rsquo;in en b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k destek&amp;ccedil;isi Boeing&amp;rsquo;i boykotta yoksunuz! K&amp;ouml;pr&amp;uuml; &amp;uuml;st&amp;uuml;nde eyleme varsınız ama k&amp;ouml;pr&amp;uuml; altından giden gemileri engellemeye yoksunuz!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805066&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;AK PARTİ SİVİL TOPLUM KURULUŞU DEĞİLDİR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Dost acı s&amp;ouml;yler&amp;rdquo;! AK Parti y&amp;ouml;neticileri, siz sivil toplum kuruluşu değilsiniz! Siz iktidarsınız! Meydanlarda eylem yapacak, televizyonlarda g&amp;ouml;zyaşı d&amp;ouml;kecek, dizilerde ajitasyon yapacak konumda değilsiniz; siz somut adımlar atacak makamdasınız!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sizin g&amp;ouml;reviniz eylem yarıştırmak değil, gerekeni yapmaktır. Bu aziz millet hamaset i&amp;ccedil;in değil, iktidar &amp;uuml;zerine d&amp;uuml;şeni yapmıyor diye miting yapıyor! Bu &amp;uuml;lkede herkes y&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;yebilir,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;eylem yapabilir, miting d&amp;uuml;zenleyebilir, pankart a&amp;ccedil;ıp slogan atabilir. Ancaaak, iktidar bunları yaparak beceriksizliğinin &amp;uuml;zerini &amp;ouml;rtemez!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805067&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;SİZ Hİ&amp;Ccedil; MİTİNG YAPAN AMERİKALI BAKAN G&amp;Ouml;RD&amp;Uuml;N&amp;Uuml;Z M&amp;Uuml;?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Siz hi&amp;ccedil; Trump&amp;rsquo;ın İsrail&amp;rsquo;e destek i&amp;ccedil;in y&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;şe davet ettiğini g&amp;ouml;rd&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml;z m&amp;uuml;? Hi&amp;ccedil; İngiliz başbakanının İsrail&amp;rsquo;e destek i&amp;ccedil;in mitinge katıldığını g&amp;ouml;rd&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml;z m&amp;uuml;? Hayır, g&amp;ouml;remezsiniz!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ccedil;&amp;uuml;nk&amp;uuml; onlar: Boeing&amp;rsquo;ten u&amp;ccedil;ak g&amp;ouml;nderirler, ZİM gemileriyle m&amp;uuml;himmat g&amp;ouml;nderirler, İslam coğrafyasını vuracak u&amp;ccedil;aklara, askeri &amp;uuml;slerinden yakıt ikmali yaparlar, en olmadı B-2 bombardıman u&amp;ccedil;ağı g&amp;ouml;nderirler&amp;hellip;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İsrail&amp;rsquo;in destek&amp;ccedil;ileri; İsrail&amp;rsquo;e, tonlarca bomba g&amp;ouml;nderirken maalesef iktidar, Gazze&amp;rsquo;ye, 1 &amp;ccedil;uval un, 1 yudum su sokamıyor.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805068&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;MİLLİ G&amp;Ouml;R&amp;Uuml;Ş G&amp;Ouml;MLEĞİ&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ya siz hangi ara bu hale geldiniz? İktidardaki arkadaşların, Milli G&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;ş g&amp;ouml;mleğini &amp;ccedil;ıkardıklarında s&amp;ouml;yledikleri c&amp;uuml;mleler hala hafızalarımızda. Ne diyorlardı: &amp;ldquo;Milli G&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;ş kafasıyla bu iş olmuyor. Biz k&amp;uuml;resel g&amp;uuml;&amp;ccedil;lerle, egemenlerle kavga ederek değil uzlaşarak y&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;yeceğiz. Milli G&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;ş g&amp;ouml;mleğini &amp;ccedil;ıkardık.&amp;rdquo; dediler.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;O y&amp;uuml;zden de &amp;ldquo;Amerika&amp;rsquo;ya direnmeyi&amp;rdquo; marjinallik olarak g&amp;ouml;rd&amp;uuml;ler. Peki şimdi ne oldu? 23 yıl sonra bug&amp;uuml;n hangi tablo ile karşı karşıyayız? Evet! Milli G&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;ş, k&amp;uuml;resel egemenlere boyun eğmediği i&amp;ccedil;in 11 ay iktidarda kalabildi. Ancak o 11 ayda; D-8&amp;rsquo;leri kurdu, TBMM&amp;rsquo;ye &amp;ldquo;Amerikan Tezkeresi&amp;rdquo; değil, &amp;ldquo;Filistin Tezkeresi&amp;rdquo; getirdi. Yetmedi, Filistin&amp;rsquo;e asker g&amp;ouml;nderdi. Lafı eğip b&amp;uuml;kmeye gerek yok! Bizim iktidarımızda 11 ayda yaptıklarımızı,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;siz bırakın 23 yıl; 230 yıl iktidarda kalsanız yine yapamazsınız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ccedil;&amp;uuml;nk&amp;uuml; bunları yapmak, ABD&amp;rsquo;ye sandalye &amp;ccedil;ektirerek değil, &amp;ldquo;Bana Ne Amerika&amp;rsquo;dan&amp;rdquo; diyerek olur. İnsan hakikaten merak ediyor: Siz hangi ara bu kadar Amerikancı oldunuz?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805069&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;SAYIN BAH&amp;Ccedil;ELİ&amp;rsquo;NİN MESAJI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Değerli Arkadaşlar, hatırlanacağı &amp;uuml;zere Sayın Bah&amp;ccedil;eli, 21 Ekim 2023&amp;rsquo;te,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;TBMM&amp;rsquo;de yaptıkları grup toplantısında, muhtemelen&amp;nbsp;ortağının kullandığı hamasi c&amp;uuml;mlelere inanarak, İsrail&amp;rsquo;e 24 saatlik m&amp;uuml;hlet vermişti. Bug&amp;uuml;n 8 Ekim 2025, bu&amp;nbsp;s&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;n &amp;uuml;zerinden 17 bin 229 saat ge&amp;ccedil;ti.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;
17 bin 229 saat ge&amp;ccedil;mesine rağmen Sayın Bah&amp;ccedil;eli&amp;rsquo;nin ortağı tarafından atılan tek bir somut adım yok. Ve bizim hala&amp;nbsp;İsrail&amp;rsquo;e karşı, tam&amp;nbsp;ambargo, tam tecrit, tam boykot ve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;kesintisiz yaptırım talebimiz devam ediyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ouml;te yandan Sayın Bah&amp;ccedil;eli&amp;rsquo;nin &amp;ldquo;İsrail&amp;rsquo;in savaşı, şiddeti ve soykırımı&amp;nbsp;devam ettirmesi halinde her t&amp;uuml;rl&amp;uuml; askeri se&amp;ccedil;enek meşru hale gelecektir. Hamas&amp;nbsp;ter&amp;ouml;r &amp;ouml;rg&amp;uuml;t&amp;uuml; değildir,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;ger&amp;ccedil;ek manasıyla ter&amp;ouml;r y&amp;ouml;ntemlerine başvuran haydut devlet İsrail&amp;rsquo;dir.&amp;rdquo; s&amp;ouml;zlerine y&amp;uuml;zde y&amp;uuml;z katılıyoruz. Ve iktidardan Sayın Bah&amp;ccedil;eli&amp;rsquo;nin bu tespitinin gereğini yapmasını talep ediyoruz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805070&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;FOTOĞRAF SİYASETİ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Değerli arkadaşlar, kitleler genellikle siyaset&amp;ccedil;ilerin konuştuklarına bakar, ancak&amp;nbsp;geleceği belirleyen atılan imzalar, yapılan anlaşmalardır. Biz kimin ne s&amp;ouml;ylediğinden ziyade neye&amp;nbsp;&amp;ldquo;evet&amp;rdquo;, neye&amp;nbsp;&amp;ldquo;hayır&amp;rdquo;&amp;nbsp;dediğine, neyi&amp;nbsp;imzaladığına bakalım derken,&amp;nbsp;siyaset&amp;nbsp;maalesef&amp;nbsp;&amp;ldquo;fotoğraf kareleri&amp;rdquo;&amp;nbsp;&amp;uuml;zerinden y&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;t&amp;uuml;l&amp;uuml;yor.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ge&amp;ccedil;tiğimiz ay hep birlikte bir ABD ziyaretine tanıklık ettik. İktidar tabanına hitap eden medya, bu&amp;nbsp;ziyaret ile ilgili, Trump&amp;rsquo;ın&amp;nbsp;Sayın Cumhurbaşkanının sandalyesini &amp;ccedil;ekmesine&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;dair g&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;nt&amp;uuml;leri servis ederken her biri skandal olan s&amp;ouml;zlerin &amp;uuml;zerinde durmadı.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Se&amp;ccedil;im hilelerini &amp;ccedil;ok iyi bilir!&amp;rdquo;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;ldquo;Bizden istedikleri tek şey meşruiyet!&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

