&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805071&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;B&amp;Uuml;Y&amp;Uuml;K ORTADOĞU PROJESİ G&amp;Uuml;NCELLENİYOR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Trump&amp;rsquo;ın&amp;nbsp;sandalye &amp;ccedil;ekmesinin, sadece&amp;nbsp;ticari anlaşmalarla ilgili olmadığının hepimiz farkındayız. Bir taraftan sandalye &amp;ccedil;ekilirken diğer taraftan B&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k Ortadoğu Projesi g&amp;uuml;ncelleniyor! Gazze&amp;rsquo;de &amp;ldquo;barış planı&amp;rdquo; adı altında Hamas&amp;rsquo;ı&amp;nbsp;silah bırakmaya ve teslim olmaya davet etmenin vebalini kimse &amp;ouml;deyemez.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Başında&amp;nbsp;Blair&amp;rsquo;in&amp;nbsp;olduğu bir manda y&amp;ouml;netimin vebalini kimse &amp;ouml;deyemez. İran&amp;rsquo;ı k&amp;ouml;şeye sıkıştırarak, İran&amp;rsquo;a m&amp;uuml;dahale ederek, b&amp;ouml;lgeyi tamamen İsrail&amp;rsquo;in istediği kıvama getirecek&amp;nbsp;adımların vebalini kimse &amp;ouml;deyemez. Bu cendereden &amp;ccedil;ıkışın tek yolu, i&amp;ccedil;eride ve dışarıda hak ve adalet ekseninde birlikteliktir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805072&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;SİYASİ PARTİLER BİRBİRİNİN HASMI DEĞİLDİR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Değerli arkadaşlar, fotoğraf karesiyle siyaset sadece Washington&amp;rsquo;dan y&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;t&amp;uuml;lm&amp;uuml;yor. Maalesef, nazik&amp;nbsp;bir davetin ve&amp;nbsp;nezaketle ge&amp;ccedil;ekleşen icabetin ardından oluşan bir fotoğraf&amp;nbsp;karesi, birlikteliği&amp;nbsp;b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;tmek yerine kutuplaşmayı artırmak i&amp;ccedil;in kullanılıyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Birlik ve beraberliği, herkesin&amp;nbsp;iktidar partisine teslim olması şeklinde okumanın&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;sorunların&amp;nbsp;&amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;m&amp;uuml;ne hi&amp;ccedil;bir katkısı olmayacaktır. Toplumsal&amp;nbsp;bir&amp;nbsp;uzlaşı zemini &amp;ccedil;abasında olan partileri iktidar&amp;nbsp;partisine teslim olmuş gibi g&amp;ouml;rmek de yapılan&amp;nbsp;yanlışlara karşı tepki g&amp;ouml;steren partileri&amp;nbsp;kriminalize&amp;nbsp;etmeye &amp;ccedil;alışmak da kimseye&amp;nbsp;bir şey kazandırmaz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Diğer taraftan &amp;ldquo;T&amp;uuml;rkiye Fotoğrafı&amp;rdquo; denilen karede ana muhalefet partisi yer almıyorsa,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İktidar, ana muhalefet partisini su&amp;ccedil;lamak yerine, kendi&amp;nbsp;politikalarını g&amp;ouml;zden ge&amp;ccedil;irmelidir. Liderlerin bir araya geldiği bir fotoğrafı, birlikteliği&amp;nbsp;b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;tmek i&amp;ccedil;in milat kabul etmek varken, toplumda kutuplaştırmayı artırıcı bir dile devam etmek, kabul edilebilir bir durum değildir.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805073&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;YENİ YASAMA YILI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Değerli arkadaşlar, malumlarınız ge&amp;ccedil;tiğimiz hafta TBMM, yeni yasama yılına başladı. Bu vesileyle; 105 yıldır aziz milletimizin taleplerinin karşılık bulduğu Meclis&amp;rsquo;imizin yeni yasama yılını kutluyor, yeni d&amp;ouml;nemde daha etkin olmasını temenni ediyorum.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Cumhurbaşkanlığı h&amp;uuml;k&amp;uuml;met sistemi ile ikinci plana d&amp;uuml;şen Meclis&amp;rsquo;imiz, &amp;ccedil;oğunluğun, demokrasinin ve &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;m&amp;uuml;n adresi olmalıdır. &amp;Ccedil;&amp;uuml;nk&amp;uuml; Meclis demek; ortak irade, istişare ve birlik demektir. Kararları başka yerden alıp, Meclis&amp;rsquo;te onaylatmak, Meclis&amp;rsquo;i noter haline getirmek, millet iradesi i&amp;ccedil;in son derece tehlikelidir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Biz bu yeni d&amp;ouml;nemde, daha &amp;ccedil;ok &amp;ccedil;alışacağız. Sadece eleştiren değil; &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;m &amp;uuml;reten, teklif sunan, takip eden bir muhalefet anlayışıyla hareket edeceğiz. Milletimizin sesi olmakla kalmayıp, onların beklentilerini meclis k&amp;uuml;rs&amp;uuml;s&amp;uuml;ne, komisyonlara, planlara ve b&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;elere taşıyacağız. Her kanun teklifinde, her araştırma &amp;ouml;nergesinde, her genel kurul konuşmasında &amp;ldquo;adil d&amp;uuml;zen&amp;rdquo; anlayışını, &amp;ldquo;hak temelli siyaset&amp;rdquo; ilkesini savunacağız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805074&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;TER&amp;Ouml;RS&amp;Uuml;Z/YAŞANABİLİR T&amp;Uuml;RKİYE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Değerli arkadaşlar, en başından beri &amp;ldquo;Ter&amp;ouml;rs&amp;uuml;z T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rdquo; olarak tanımlanan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;ve bizim &amp;ldquo;Yaşanabilir Bir T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rdquo; hedefi &amp;ccedil;er&amp;ccedil;evesinde değerlendirdiğimiz s&amp;uuml;rece&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;desteğimizi a&amp;ccedil;ık&amp;ccedil;a ifade ettik. Elbette biz akan&amp;nbsp;kanı durduracak, şiddete&amp;nbsp;son verecek,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;siyasetin&amp;nbsp;alanını genişletecek, hak&amp;nbsp;ve &amp;ouml;zg&amp;uuml;rl&amp;uuml;kler &amp;uuml;zerindeki kısıtlamaların kalkmasına vesile olacak, dilin, kimliğin, k&amp;uuml;lt&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;n, inancın ve d&amp;uuml;ş&amp;uuml;ncenin kendisini ifade etmesine en uygun zemini hazırlayacak, barış, huzur ve kardeşlik iklimini tesis edecek, t&amp;uuml;m&amp;nbsp;bunları hukuk ile şekillendirecek her samimi adımı destekliyoruz.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ancak kayyım uygulamalarını devam ettirerek, sosyal medya paylaşımlarından dolayı insanları g&amp;ouml;zaltılarla, tutuklamalarla sindirerek KHK&amp;rsquo;lıların, askeri okul &amp;ouml;ğrencilerinin, adalet arayışına kulak&amp;nbsp;tıkayarak, Barış Akademisyenlerini, &amp;uuml;niversite k&amp;uuml;rs&amp;uuml;lerinden uzak tutarak, asgari &amp;uuml;cretliye ve emekliye sadaka ayarında maaş vererek, ev gen&amp;ccedil;lerinin sayısını artırarak, kadınların, &amp;ccedil;ocukların, yaşlıların ve&amp;nbsp;engellilerin varlıklarını yok sayarak, esnaf ve &amp;ccedil;ift&amp;ccedil;inin sorunlarını g&amp;ouml;rmezden gelerek, polisi, mesai mefhumunu g&amp;ouml;zetmeyerek, bu &amp;uuml;lkede hi&amp;ccedil;bir mesele &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;lemez.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Milli Dayanışma, Kardeşlik ve Demokrasi Komisyonu&amp;rsquo;nun &amp;ccedil;alışmalarını, sadece&amp;nbsp;&amp;ouml;rg&amp;uuml;t&amp;uuml;n silah bırakmasına indirgeyip, bu&amp;nbsp;&amp;uuml;lkede farklı kesimlerin hak ve adalet arayışını yok sayarak hi&amp;ccedil;bir mesele &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;lemez.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;T&amp;uuml;rk, K&amp;uuml;rt, Arap, Farisi ve b&amp;ouml;lgenin t&amp;uuml;m halkları, hak&amp;nbsp;ve adalet zemininde, bir araya gelip, g&amp;uuml;&amp;ccedil;l&amp;uuml;&amp;nbsp;bir barışı inşa etme imk&amp;acirc;nı varken, ABD ve İsrail ile iş tutarak Filistin&amp;rsquo;de ve Suriye&amp;rsquo;de Beyaz Saray&amp;rsquo;ın direktifleri doğrultusunda adımlar atarak hi&amp;ccedil;bir mesele &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;lemez.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Biz Saadet Partisi olarak &amp;uuml;zerimize d&amp;uuml;şeni yapıyoruz. Bir kez daha ifade ediyorum:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Dayanışma ve kardeşlik sadece silahların susmasıyla değil, bu coğrafyanın her bir insanının ekonomik, k&amp;uuml;lt&amp;uuml;rel, sosyal ve siyasal a&amp;ccedil;ıdan kendini tam anlamıyla iyi hissetmesiyle ger&amp;ccedil;ekleşir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805075&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;ESAS KONUŞULMASI GEREKEN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Değerli arkadaşlar, T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;de trollerin, yorumcularının, analistlerin &amp;ldquo;Siyasetin g&amp;uuml;ndemi budur&amp;rdquo; dediği fotoğrafların dışında bir ger&amp;ccedil;eklik var. Bizler i&amp;ccedil;in ger&amp;ccedil;ek g&amp;uuml;ndem, aziz milletimizin i&amp;ccedil;inde olduğu ekonomik buhrandır!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Esas konuşulması gereken; &amp;ldquo;D&amp;uuml;ş&amp;uuml;yor&amp;rdquo; dedikleri enflasyonun karşısında 5.621 lira eriyen asgari &amp;uuml;crettir. 12 trilyon 652 milyar vergi &amp;ouml;deyen bir milletin her ge&amp;ccedil;en g&amp;uuml;n yoksullaşmasıdır. Bu milletin alın terinden, yılın ilk 8 ayında yapılan 1,4 trilyon faiz &amp;ouml;demesidir. Alım fiyatı karşısında &amp;ccedil;aresiz kalan pancar &amp;uuml;reticisidir, &amp;ccedil;ift&amp;ccedil;idir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805076&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;EMEKLİNİN SU&amp;Ccedil;U NE?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Esas konuşulması gereken, emeklinin i&amp;ccedil;ine d&amp;uuml;şt&amp;uuml;ğ&amp;uuml; durumdur. Daha d&amp;uuml;n AK Parti Genel Başkan Yardımcısı Nihat Zeybek&amp;ccedil;i, &amp;ldquo;Emeklilik yaşı &amp;ccedil;ok d&amp;uuml;ş&amp;uuml;k.&amp;rdquo; dedi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ge&amp;ccedil;en hafta &amp;Ccedil;alışma Bakanı da &amp;ccedil;ıkıp, &amp;ldquo;Emeklilerin maaşını zor koşulda olsak da &amp;ouml;d&amp;uuml;yoruz&amp;rdquo; dedi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sizin emekliyle derdiniz ne? Emeklinin canından başka alacak neyini bıraktınız!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bak ben size s&amp;ouml;yleyeyim: Siz Amerika&amp;rsquo;dayken ben de Erzurum&amp;rsquo;daydım. Orada Yakutiye meydanında, emeklimizle, &amp;ouml;ğrencimizle, iş&amp;ccedil;imizle beraberdim. Bir emekli amcamız, kalktı bana ne dedi biliyor musunuz? &amp;ldquo;Ben &amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml;m&amp;uuml;zdeki g&amp;uuml;nlerde Ankara&amp;rsquo;ya gideceğim ve b&amp;ouml;breğimi satacağım. Benim başka &amp;ccedil;arem kalmadı&amp;rdquo; dedi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İşte a&amp;ccedil;lık sınırının altına mahkum ettiğiniz emeklinin durumu bu! Bug&amp;uuml;n aramızda &amp;ldquo;Emeklilikte Adalet Derneği, EMADDER&amp;rdquo; var. Bu vesileyle ben de onlara hoş geldiniz diyor, emeklilikte adalet arayışlarını desteklediğimizi ifade ediyorum.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805077&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;ENDİŞEYE MAHAL YOK!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Değerli arkadaşlar, işte yeni yasama yılında bizler, konuşulmayan bu konuları konuşmak, &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;m &amp;uuml;retilmeyen konulara &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;m &amp;uuml;retmek, harekete ge&amp;ccedil;ilmeyen yerlerde harekete ge&amp;ccedil;mek &amp;uuml;zere &amp;ccedil;alışacağız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Şu bilinmelidir ki: Erbakan Hocamız, Oğuzhan Asilt&amp;uuml;rk, Recai Kutan, Temel Karamollaoğlu B&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;ğ&amp;uuml;m&amp;uuml;z, 1969 yılında yola &amp;ccedil;ıktıklarında bir&amp;ccedil;oğumuz hayatta yoktu. Ama onlar bizim i&amp;ccedil;in, sonraki nesiller i&amp;ccedil;in, Yaşanabilir bir T&amp;uuml;rkiye i&amp;ccedil;in &amp;ccedil;alıştı.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ben de şimdi buradan gen&amp;ccedil;lere sesleniyorum: Sizler gelecekte Yeniden B&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;ye ulaşın diye bug&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml;n sorunlarını biz &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;zeceğiz, bunun i&amp;ccedil;in b&amp;uuml;t&amp;uuml;n g&amp;uuml;c&amp;uuml;m&amp;uuml;zle &amp;ccedil;alışacağız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Endişeye mahal, karamsarlığa yer yok. Allah&amp;rsquo;ın izniyle hep birlikte 86 milyon insanımızın ve yolumuzu g&amp;ouml;zleyen mazlumların imdadına yetişecek, sorunlarını &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;zeceğiz. Ya bir yol bulacağız, ya bir yol a&amp;ccedil;acağız. Allah yar ve yardımcımız olsun.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc210805078&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;RECAİ KUTAN&amp;rsquo;IN VEFAT YIL D&amp;Ouml;N&amp;Uuml;M&amp;Uuml;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;S&amp;ouml;zlerimi bitirirken; bir yıl &amp;ouml;nce, ahirete irtihal eden Erbakan hocamızın yakın dostu, Milli G&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;ş hareketinin dava b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;ğ&amp;uuml;, T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;de GAP başta olmak &amp;uuml;zere bir&amp;ccedil;ok b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k projenin m&amp;uuml;hendisi Kurucu Genel Başkanımız Recai Kutan b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;ğ&amp;uuml;m&amp;uuml;z&amp;uuml; rahmetle anıyor, hepinizi sevgi ve muhabbetle selamlıyorum.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
